{%- comment -%}
  CRO-12526 — Gallery wrapper.

  Reuses `product-media-gallery-custom` (Swiper main-slider + thumbs-container +
  the existing full-screen "zoomin" image viewer popup) completely unchanged —
  per spec the popup itself must not be touched. This snippet only:
    1. Adds the promo/bestseller tag INSIDE the gallery, top-left, above the main
       image (moved here from its old spot above the product title in
       main-product_crp.liquid — see `best-seller-tag.liquid`, reused unchanged).
    2. Adds a "View all images" link below the gallery that opens the same popup
       by clicking the existing #product-slider-zoom trigger (see cro-12526-pdp.js).
    3. Restyles thumbnail active-state border + hides the inline prev/next arrows
       (CSS only, in cro-12526-pdp.css) — arrows inside the zoomed popup itself are
       left alone since the popup is "unchanged" per spec.
    4. Swipe gestures are already native Swiper.js behaviour — no extra JS needed.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="cro12526-gallery">
  <div class="cro12526-gallery__tag">
    {%- render 'best-seller-tag' -%}
  </div>

  {% render 'product-media-gallery-custom' %}

  <button type="button" class="cro12526-gallery__view-all" data-cro12526-view-all-images>
    <span>view all images</span>
    <span class="cro12526-gallery__view-all-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      {{- 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
    </span>
  </button>

  {%- comment -%} Mobile-only range/SKU block, per spec displays below the gallery on mobile instead of beside the breadcrumb. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- render 'cro-12526-breadcrumb-meta', context: 'mobile' -%}
</div>
